{"t":1454329.3123485,"req":"h05","event":"done","status":"answered","level":0,"steps":["classify","retrieve","draft"],"answer":"The smoothing module solves the difficulty of training with discrete chunk boundaries \u2013 it makes the boundary\u2011learning operation differentiable so gradients can flow through chunking, prevents unstable or over\u2011fitted chunk patterns, and provides adaptive error\u2011correction for low\u2011confidence chunks[C:dynchunk:22]. It is essential for stable training dynamics, as removing it causes compression\u2011ratio fluctuations[C:dynchunk:65]."}
